{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04601","headline":"杂诗四首 二 · 张说","name":"杂诗四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山闲苦积雨，木落悲时遽。\n赏心凡几人，良辰在何处？\n触石满堂侈，洒我终夕虑。\n客鸟怀主人，衔花未能去。\n剖珠贵分明，琢玉思坚贞。\n要君意如此，终始莫相轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}